# The production image needs only the Go API module and bootstrap seed files.
# A whitelist keeps local secrets, caches and unrelated app builds out of the
# Docker daemon and out of every remote build context by construction.
**
!Dockerfile
!services/
!services/api/
!services/api/**
!services/worker/
!services/worker/**
!data/
!data/seed-data/
!data/seed-data/**
!go.work
!go.work.sum

# Secrets remain excluded even if a future negation broadens the context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
